section(class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-5")
    div(class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-zinc-200 pb-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between")
        div(class="max-w-3xl")
            p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500") OpenID Connect Provider
            h1(class="mt-1.5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950") RP 등록, Discovery/JWKS, authorize/logout 검증
            p(class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-zinc-600")
                | Authorization Code, PKCE, userinfo, end session 흐름을 RP 기준으로 확인합니다.
        div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-1")
            a(routerLink="/oidc/register", [class]="tabClass('register')") Register RP
            a(routerLink="/oidc/publish", [class]="tabClass('publish')") Discovery
            a(routerLink="/oidc/authorizecheck", [class]="tabClass('authorizecheck')") Authorize
            a(routerLink="/oidc/logoutcheck", [class]="tabClass('logoutcheck')") Logout

    div(class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4")
        div(*ngIf="isTab('register')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-rp-register

        div(*ngIf="isTab('publish')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-provider-publish

        div(*ngIf="isTab('authorizecheck')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-authorize-check

        div(*ngIf="isTab('logoutcheck')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-logout-check
